---

Bundled assets and datasets ship under their respective licenses:

- `skills/_assets/fonts/inter-variable.woff2` — Inter Variable typeface,
  copyright Rasmus Andersson, licensed under the SIL Open Font License v1.1
  (https://github.com/rsms/inter/blob/master/LICENSE.txt). Forks may
  swap in a different brand font by replacing the woff2 at the same
  path; design.py reads whatever is at that location and falls back
  to the system-ui chain when the file is missing.

- `skills/playbooks/ai-exposure/data/anthropic-aei-onet-*.csv` and
  `anthropic-task-penetration.csv` — Anthropic Economic Index dataset,
  copyright Anthropic, licensed under CC BY 4.0
  (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
